{
  "description": "Durable Object-managed containers carry the application name and a map of named, prepared image references in Worker metadata. Preserve these fields on uploads and version responses. Source: https://github.com/cloudflare/workers-sdk/blob/main/packages/deploy-helpers/src/deploy/helpers/durable-object-container-applications.ts (2026-09-30).",
  "patches": [
